data: {"id": "9ea8f97787934d0f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1171", "run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "query_pod_topology 调用成功。拓扑证据显示：\n\n- Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 运行在 `node2` 节点上。\n- Pod 属于 ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c`，该 ReplicaSet 属于 Deployment `workload`。\n- Pod 包含一个名为 `app` 的容器。\n\n拓扑维度已覆盖，证据充足，不再需要额外补证。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789058889417, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "9ea8f97787934d0f-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "seq": 1172, "ts_ms": 1789058896823, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 348.388, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9ea8f97787934d0f-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "58c52571a3cf6e53b176c802ec854d0d0d909f473ea1444f5209bc130946f8bc", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "d39aec8b15fffb7c8361fbef64539d6650c10f78b8a6cc3cec0cc28aacfb4960"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "9ea8f97787934d0f-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "seq": 1173, "ts_ms": 1789058896824, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "9ea8f97787934d0f-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "seq": 1174, "ts_ms": 1789058905573, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.749, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1766, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh 在 aiops-case-05 命名空间中卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，Pod Phase 为 Pending，且无法创建容器沙箱。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接表明 Multus 插件找不到所需的网络定义资源，是导致失败的直接原因。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... Multus: ... error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate ... \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 验证了容器沙箱创建因网络插件配置缺失而失败，证实了 `ContainerCreating` 卡住的具体机制。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubelet | `container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` | 确认应用容器 `app` 处于等待启动状态，与事件描述一致。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, value: `1`) | 从指标层面确认了 Pod 处于等待容器创建的状态，支持了现象描述。 |\n\n证据链闭合：Kubernetes 事件明确指出 `multus` 插件在尝试解析 `unavailable-network` 网络定义时返回 `not found` 错误，直接导致 `kubelet` 无法创建容器沙箱，进而使 Pod 维持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。指标与状态事实佐证了这一现象的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置了引用不存在资源 'unavailable-network' 的网络注解 → Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络定义并抛出错误 → 容器沙箱创建失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置了引用名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络注解，但该名称的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化网络时无法获取所需的代理配置（证据 1、2），从而阻止了容器沙箱的成功创建，最终表现为 Pod 永远无法通过 `ContainerCreating` 阶段进入运行状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh 在 aiops-case-05 命名空间中卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，Pod Phase 为 Pending，且无法创建容器沙箱。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接表明 Multus 插件找不到所需的网络定义资源，是导致失败的直接原因。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... Multus: ... error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate ... \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 验证了容器沙箱创建因网络插件配置缺失而失败，证实了 `ContainerCreating` 卡住的具体机制。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubelet | `container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` | 确认应用容器 `app` 处于等待启动状态，与事件描述一致。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, value: `1`) | 从指标层面确认了 Pod 处于等待容器创建的状态，支持了现象描述。 |\n\n证据链闭合：Kubernetes 事件明确指出 `multus` 插件在尝试解析 `unavailable-network` 网络定义时返回 `not found` 错误，直接导致 `kubelet` 无法创建容器沙箱，进而使 Pod 维持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。指标与状态事实佐证了这一现象的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置了引用不存在资源 'unavailable-network' 的网络注解 → Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络定义并抛出错误 → 容器沙箱创建失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置了引用名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络注解，但该名称的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化网络时无法获取所需的代理配置（证据 1、2），从而阻止了容器沙箱的成功创建，最终表现为 Pod 永远无法通过 `ContainerCreating` 阶段进入运行状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "9ea8f97787934d0f-final", "run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "seq": 1176, "ts_ms": 1789058905583, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh 在 aiops-case-05 命名空间中卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，Pod Phase 为 Pending，且无法创建容器沙箱。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接表明 Multus 插件找不到所需的网络定义资源，是导致失败的直接原因。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox ... Multus: ... error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate ... \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 验证了容器沙箱创建因网络插件配置缺失而失败，证实了 `ContainerCreating` 卡住的具体机制。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubelet | `container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` | 确认应用容器 `app` 处于等待启动状态，与事件描述一致。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, value: `1`) | 从指标层面确认了 Pod 处于等待容器创建的状态，支持了现象描述。 |\n\n证据链闭合：Kubernetes 事件明确指出 `multus` 插件在尝试解析 `unavailable-network` 网络定义时返回 `not found` 错误，直接导致 `kubelet` 无法创建容器沙箱，进而使 Pod 维持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。指标与状态事实佐证了这一现象的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置了引用不存在资源 'unavailable-network' 的网络注解 → Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络定义并抛出错误 → 容器沙箱创建失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置了引用名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络注解，但该名称的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化网络时无法获取所需的代理配置（证据 1、2），从而阻止了容器沙箱的成功创建，最终表现为 Pod 永远无法通过 `ContainerCreating` 阶段进入运行状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 6.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 348.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 348.4s (Evidence 341.1s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 374.761, "metrics": {"run_id": "9ea8f97787934d0f", "mttr": {"value": "6.2m", "seconds": 374.7682087421417, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 374768.2087421417, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 63962.100982666016, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 347985.6667518616, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 310314.82195854187}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17609.694719314575, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 348388.4708881378, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8749.217748641968, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

